{"version":1,"content":"<p>【23：53更新】今日（13日）晚上6時許，警方接獲報案，指長青隧道往九龍方向出口發生多車相撞交通意外。</p><p>初步調查顯示，涉及3輛私家車及2輛輕型貨車，其中3名司機受輕傷，由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.400303+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723560+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723560+00:00","content_hash":"944e9ad35273cfb5b5c062ff239ca04cfd7dabfdca9f746211f3c07bba6b0872","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}